<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Prepaid
expenses mainly comprise prepaid marketing expenses, consultancy fees, and professional fees paid upfront under contracts with terms
generally ranging from one to five years. These amounts are recognized as expenses on a straight-line basis over the relevant non-cancellable
contract term or expected benefit period, so the balances are realized over the life of the underlying arrangements, with the portion
expected to be expensed within the next twelve months classified as current and the remainder as non-current.</span></p>

